hing.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1192_e_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"missilysresearch","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1192_e_10","text":"No, not that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1192_e_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"missilysresearch","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1192_e_11","text":"It can potentially even stand toe-to-toe","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1192_e_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"missilysresearch","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1192_e_12","text":"with a Nikke.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1192_e_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"missilysresearch","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1192_e_13","text":"We may be able to outfit it with new weaponry for use in surface retrieval operations.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1192_e_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"missilysresearch","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1192_e_14","text":"The possibilities are simply endless!","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1192_e_15","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1192_e_15","text":"If I didn't know any better, I'd say you're happy that we failed.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1192_e_16","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1192_e_16","text":"For a while, there is no response.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1192_e_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"missilysresearch","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1192_e_17","text":"Don't be ridiculous.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1192_e_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"missilysresearch","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1192_e_18","text":"It's far from that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1192_e_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"missilysresearch","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1192_e_19","text":"Since you failed to accomplish the task we set out for you,","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1192_e_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"missilysresearch","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1192_e_20","text":"I'm sure it will come as no surprise that there won't be any","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1192_e_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"missilysresearch","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1192_e_21","text":"compensation forthcoming.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1192_e_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"missilysresearch","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1192_e_22","text":"You did your best.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1192_e_23","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1192_e_23","text":"Give me one last chance.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1192_e_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"missilysresearch","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1192_e_24","text":"??","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1192_e_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"missilysresearch","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1192_e_25","text":"Why should we?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1192_e_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"missilysresearch","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1192_e_26","text":"Do you really need the reward that badly?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1192_e_27","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1192_e_27","text":"Yes.","jump":"m_subquest_1192_e_29"},{"id":"m_subquest_1192_e_28","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1192_e_28","text":"That's not it.","jump":"m_subquest_1192_e_33"},{"id":"m_subquest_1192_e_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"missilysresearch","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1192_e_29","text":"Well, I find that rather surprising.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1192_e_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"missilysresearch","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1192_e_30","text":"After all, you're one of the most famous Commanders in the entire Ark.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1192_e_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"missilysresearch","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1192_e_31","text":"Yet, you spend your life in poverty like the rest of us.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1192_e_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"missilysresearch","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1192_e_32","text":"A slave to your next paycheck.","jump":"m_subquest_1192_e_40"},{"id":"m_subquest_1192_e_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"missilysresearch","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1192_e_33","text":"What then?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1192_e_34","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1192_e_34","text":"My pride.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1192_e_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"missilysresearch","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1192_e_35","text":"Pride?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1192_e_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"missilysresearch","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1192_e_36","text":"I can understand that","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1192_e_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"missilysresearch","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1192_e_37","text":"but don't take any of this too personally.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1192_e_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"missilysresearch","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1192_e_38","text":"It's perfectly normal for any human to","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1192_e_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"missilysresearch","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1192_e_39","text":"cower before the might of Missilis technology.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1192_e_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"missilysresearch","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1192_e_40","text":"Very well then.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1192_e_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"missilysresearch","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1192_e_41","text":"One more chance.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1192_e_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"missilysresearch","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1192_e_42","text":"Your last one.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1192_e_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"missilysresearch","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1192_e_43","text":"After I establish Volt Jr.'s location,","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1192_e_44","type":"Speech","sp